# Local deployment/operations notes — host and VM topology, SSH details,
# cluster access, anything that fingerprints live infrastructure.
#
# These patterns are deliberately broader than the one file they started as:
# deploy/LOCAL.md was listed here and STILL ended up committed, because adding
# a path to .gitignore does not untrack a file already in the index. If you add
# a local ops note, name it to match one of these AND run
# `git check-ignore -v <file>` to confirm before you touch git add.
deploy/LOCAL.md
**/LOCAL.md
**/*.local.md
**/*.local.yaml
.local/
keys/